WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.974
Welcome to the wonderful world of Connie Reporting!

00:00:03.974 --> 00:00:10.666
Every Connie account — no matter the size — comes equipped with state-of-the-art reporting, built right in.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:20.062
From the day you go live, Connie quietly keeps track of every conversation: who reached out, how they reached out, and how your team responded.

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:25.225
Your Basic Reporting dashboard turns all of that into a clear, at-a-glance picture.

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:35.547
You'll see how many people reached out, how many you helped, your reach rate, and your channel mix — phone, email, web, and fax — all in one place.

00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:37.369
And it's yours to shape.

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:41.527
Focus on a single program or department from the dropdown.

00:00:41.527 --> 00:00:47.043
Look back over the last three months, the last year, or further, with the time range.

00:00:47.043 --> 00:00:52.206
And when you need the raw numbers, one click downloads a clean spreadsheet.

00:00:52.206 --> 00:00:56.025
Reporting is available to admins and supervisors.

00:00:56.025 --> 00:01:07.798
Supervisors get the full picture right out of the box, and admins can customize and fully configure how reporting works for your organization — you'll find all of that in the Admin section.

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:09.919
So when might you want more?

00:01:09.919 --> 00:01:20.894
If your funders, your county, or your board need numbers formatted a specific way — for a grant, for compliance, for that quarterly report — that's where Connie Advanced Reporting comes in.

00:01:20.894 --> 00:01:25.261
The same trusted data, dressed and ready for submission.

00:01:25.261 --> 00:01:27.760
But that's a story for another video.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.720
For now — welcome aboard, and happy reporting.

